00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Gentle orchestral music]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[Birdsong over a sunlit meadow]

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[A stream burbles past flowering grass]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
[Music swells warmly]

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:45.000
[A large grey rabbit yawns and stretches at the mouth of his burrow]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:56.000
[He sniffs the morning air and smiles]

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:08.000
[The rabbit strolls through the meadow, admiring a butterfly]

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:20.000
[Playful woodwinds as he cradles a fallen apple]

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:35.000
[Three small rodents watch from a tree branch, snickering]

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:50.000
[An acorn bounces off the rabbit's head. The snickering grows louder]
